    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kamaloba ka kaakabwa khu kholo cha Efuraimu ne Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamaloba ka kaakabwa khu lisaaye lia Yosefu karakikhira siimbi khu luuchi lwa Yoritani ebukwe we kameechi ka Yeriko, khubirira mu sichiimi, khukhwola e sibala sie bikulu ne khucha khukhwola Beteli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama e Beteli, lulwakha lwamalatana khukhwola Lusu, lwachiililila lwola khu Ataroti-atari, niio Baariki bamenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala lwacha elubeka we mumbo elubeka we Bayafuleti, khukhwola elubeka lwe mwaalo owa Beti-horoni. Lwama ao lwacha lwola khu Keseri, mala lwaweela mu nyanja eya Mediterenia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisaaye lia Yosefu, ekholo eya Efuraimu ne ekholo eya Manase eyaba lubeka lwe mumbo, banyoola kamaloba kano nga kumukabwa kwabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Efuraimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano kaba kamaloba ke lisaaye lia Efuraimu: Lulwakha lwabwe lwama khu Ataroti-Atari khucha ebukwe khukhwola Beti-horoni eya ngaaki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mala khukhwama ao khukhwola khu nyanja eya Mediterenia. Mikimetati siaba lubeka lwabwe lwe bunaswa. Ebukwe eye lulwakha lwalola Taanati-shilo mala lwacha lwabirira ebukwe owa Yanoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala lwekha khukhwama Yanoa lwola Ataroti ne Naara, khukhwola Yeriko mala lwakamila khu luuchi lwa Yoritani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lulwakha lwacha lubeka lwe mumbo khukhwama Tapua khukhwola khu luuchi lwa Kana mala lwakama khu nyanja eya Mediterenia. Kano kali kamaloba ka kaakabwa khu lisaaye lie kholo eya Efuraimu nga kumukabwa kwabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chingoba chindalakho ne birekere bibiaba mu sibala sisiakabwa khu Manase, biatasibwa khu Baefuraimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
